    <entry>
      <title>Vol.01 Atomsk创建Si/SiC基础结构</title>
      <link href="/2026/05/04/hello-world/"/>
      <url>/2026/05/04/hello-world/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="摘要📌"><a href="#摘要📌" class="headerlink" title="摘要📌"></a>摘要📌</h2><ul><li>   当前最终采用的模型为 12×12 Si &#x2F; 15×15 3C-SiC(001) 界面 slab：Si 位于下方作为基底，3C-SiC 位于上方，SiC 的 C 端面接触 Si；z 方向加约 20 Å 真空层。</li><li>   面内匹配采用保持 Si 基底尺寸不变、对 3C-SiC 施加约 -0.34% 的 x&#x2F;y 面内压缩。12×a(Si)&#x3D;65.172 Å，15×a(SiC)&#x3D;65.394 Å，失配约 0.34%。</li><li>   经过错误排查后确认：先前界面最近 Si-C 距离为 3.2478 Å 的构型不合理，属于界面接触过远&#x2F;未有效成键的结构。当前修正方案通过给 Si 基底上方加 0.53 Å 的 z 向间距调节，并采用 C Si 顺序创建 SiC，以保证 C 端面接触 Si。</li><li>   当前 LAMMPS 使用 SiC.tersoff 势函数、boundary p p f、固定底部 10 Å Si 基底、不使用 box&#x2F;relax，先 CG 粗弛豫，再 FIRE 精弛豫。最终 FIRE 后 Fmax&#x3D;2.047×10^-5 eV&#x2F;Å，说明 0 K 经典势几何弛豫已经非常充分。</li><li>   对 FIRE 输出 data 文件进行定量检查后，原子数、元素比例、z 向层次、真空层、C 端面、最近邻距离均合理；界面处存在周期性的浅蓝色局部凸起，应主要理解为 12:15 近重合界面中局部 Si-C 成键与配位差异，不宜直接视为错误。</li><li>   当前结构可称为“ LAMMPS&#x2F;SiC.tersoff 经典势下充分弛豫后的 Si&#x2F;3C-SiC(001) C 端面界面结构 ”。若后续需要电子结构、界面能、差分电荷密度、DOS 等高精度结论，建议继续做 DFT；若只讨论经典势下的界面几何，可作为最终 LAMMPS 结构使用。</li></ul><h2 id="模型目标与物理设定📝"><a href="#模型目标与物理设定📝" class="headerlink" title="模型目标与物理设定📝"></a>模型目标与物理设定📝</h2><p>本阶段的目标是构建一个中等尺寸的 Si &#x2F; 3C-SiC(001) 界面模型，并使用 LAMMPS 对其进行经典势预弛豫。模型用于描述 Si 基底上方外延&#x2F;接触 3C-SiC 薄层的原子结构。<br></p><table><thead><tr><th align="left">项目</th><th align="left">当前设置</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">界面体系</td><td align="left">Si &#x2F; 3C-SiC</td></tr><tr><td align="left">晶面取向</td><td align="left">Si(001) &#x2F; 3C-SiC(001)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">平面内匹配</td><td align="left">12×12 Si &#x2F; 15×15 SiC</td></tr><tr><td align="left">z向厚度</td><td align="left">Si: 8个常规晶胞；SiC: 8个常规晶胞</td></tr><tr><td align="left">基底与上层</td><td align="left">Si为下方基底，3C-SiC为上层</td></tr><tr><td align="left">端面设定</td><td align="left">C端面接触 Si基底</td></tr><tr><td align="left">真空层</td><td align="left">z方向加约 20 Å 真空层</td></tr><tr><td align="left">LAMMPS边界</td><td align="left">boundary p p f，即 x&#x2F;y-周期，z-非周期固定边界</td></tr><tr><td align="left">基底约束</td><td align="left">固定底部 10 Å 的 Si 原子</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="Atomsk-构建代码📝"><a href="#Atomsk-构建代码📝" class="headerlink" title="Atomsk 构建代码📝"></a>Atomsk 构建代码📝</h2><ul><li>手动逐条复制下方指令到Atomsk</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">atomsk --create diamond 5.431 Si orient [100] [010] [001] -duplicate 12 12 8 Si_supercell.xsf <span class="comment"># 创建Si超胞</span></span><br><span class="line">atomsk Si_supercell.xsf -cell add 0.53 z Si_supercell_gap.xsf <span class="comment"># 留0.53Å间隙</span></span><br><span class="line">atomsk --create zincblende 4.3596 C Si orient [100] [010] [001] -duplicate 15 15 8 SiC_supercell.xsf <span class="comment"># 创建SiC超胞（C在最底层）</span></span><br><span class="line">atomsk SiC_supercell.xsf -deform x -0.34% -deform y -0.34% SiC_scaled.xsf <span class="comment"># SiC面内压缩</span></span><br><span class="line">atomsk --merge z 2 Si_supercell_gap.xsf SiC_scaled.xsf interface.xsf <span class="comment"># 合并结构 注意文件名的变化</span></span><br><span class="line">atomsk interface.xsf -cell add 20 z interface_vaccum.lmp <span class="comment"># 加真空 该真空只加在一侧 需要自行居中</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># atomsk interface_vaccum.xsf -shift 0 0 10 Si_3CSiC_001_Cterm_interface_vac.xsf lmp # 真空居中</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><table><thead><tr><th align="left">代码步骤</th><th align="left">作用</th><th align="left">注意点</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">创建Si</td><td align="left">建立 diamond-Si，12×12×8 超胞</td><td align="left">下方作为基底</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Si加0.53Å间距</td><td align="left">调节界面接触距离</td><td align="left">比直接 shift 后再 wrap 更稳定</td></tr><tr><td align="left">创建SiC</td><td align="left">用 zincblende C-Si 建立 3C-SiC</td><td align="left">C写在前面用于得到 C端基面接触 Si</td></tr><tr><td align="left">SiC面内压缩</td><td align="left">x&#x2F;y 方向 -0.34%</td><td align="left">匹配 12×12 Si 面内尺寸</td></tr><tr><td align="left">沿z合并</td><td align="left">Si在下，SiC在上</td><td align="left">形成 Si&#x2F;SiC 界面 slab</td></tr><tr><td align="left">加真空层</td><td align="left">z方向增加 20Å</td><td align="left">用于避免上表面与边界相互作用</td></tr></tbody></table><ul><li>自动化bash脚本，直接运行即可：创建txt文档，将下方代码复制进去，然后将后缀改成.sh即可</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#!/bin/bash</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">set</span> -e</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># =========================================================</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Si / 3C-SiC(001) Interface Construction</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 12x12 Si substrate / 15x15 SiC film</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># C-terminated SiC on top</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># =========================================================</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ---------- 基本参数 ----------</span></span><br><span class="line">aSi=5.431          <span class="comment"># Si lattice constant (Å)</span></span><br><span class="line">aSiC=4.3596        <span class="comment"># 3C-SiC lattice constant (Å)</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">nxSi=12; nySi=12; nzSi=8</span><br><span class="line">nxSiC=15; nySiC=15; nzSiC=8</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># In-plane strain to match Si substrate</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># eps = (12*aSi)/(15*aSiC) - 1</span></span><br><span class="line">epsSiC=-0.003394806863015</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">interface_gap=0.53   <span class="comment"># extra spacing between Si top and SiC bottom (Å)</span></span><br><span class="line">vacuum=20.0         <span class="comment"># vacuum layer above SiC (Å)</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ---------- 1. Si substrate ----------</span></span><br><span class="line">atomsk --create diamond <span class="variable">$&#123;aSi&#125;</span> Si \</span><br><span class="line">  orient <span class="string">&#x27;[100]&#x27;</span> <span class="string">&#x27;[010]&#x27;</span> <span class="string">&#x27;[001]&#x27;</span> \</span><br><span class="line">  -duplicate <span class="variable">$&#123;nxSi&#125;</span> <span class="variable">$&#123;nySi&#125;</span> <span class="variable">$&#123;nzSi&#125;</span> \</span><br><span class="line">  Si_substrate_12x12x8.xsf</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">atomsk Si_substrate_12x12x8.xsf \</span><br><span class="line">  -cell add <span class="variable">$&#123;interface_gap&#125;</span> z \</span><br><span class="line">  Si_substrate_12x12x8_gap.xsf</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ---------- 2. 3C-SiC slab ----------</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># &quot;C Si&quot; ensures C-terminated interface at z = 0</span></span><br><span class="line">atomsk --create zb <span class="variable">$&#123;aSiC&#125;</span> C Si \</span><br><span class="line">  orient <span class="string">&#x27;[100]&#x27;</span> <span class="string">&#x27;[010]&#x27;</span> <span class="string">&#x27;[001]&#x27;</span> \</span><br><span class="line">  -duplicate <span class="variable">$&#123;nxSiC&#125;</span> <span class="variable">$&#123;nySiC&#125;</span> <span class="variable">$&#123;nzSiC&#125;</span> \</span><br><span class="line">  -deform x <span class="variable">$&#123;epsSiC&#125;</span> 0.0 \</span><br><span class="line">  -deform y <span class="variable">$&#123;epsSiC&#125;</span> 0.0 \</span><br><span class="line">  SiC_3C_15x15x8_Cterm_strained.xsf</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ---------- 3. Merge Si + SiC ----------</span></span><br><span class="line">atomsk --merge z 2 \</span><br><span class="line">  Si_substrate_12x12x8_gap.xsf \</span><br><span class="line">  SiC_3C_15x15x8_Cterm_strained.xsf \</span><br><span class="line">  Si_3CSiC_001_Cterm_interface_noVac.xsf</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ---------- 4. Add vacuum ----------</span></span><br><span class="line">atomsk Si_3CSiC_001_Cterm_interface_noVac.xsf \</span><br><span class="line">  -cell add <span class="variable">$&#123;vacuum&#125;</span> z \</span><br><span class="line">  -wrap \</span><br><span class="line">  Si_3CSiC_001_Cterm_interface_vac.xsf lmp cfg</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="注意事项💡"><a href="#注意事项💡" class="headerlink" title="注意事项💡"></a>注意事项💡</h2><h3 id="Lammps弛豫"><a href="#Lammps弛豫" class="headerlink" title="Lammps弛豫"></a>Lammps弛豫</h3><p>结构弛豫：该模型仅为几何拼接，建议在 LAMMPS 中进行能量最小化与 MD 弛豫</p><ul><li>粗弛豫，采用 cg 算法进行能量最小化</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br><span class="line">63</span><br><span class="line">64</span><br><span class="line">65</span><br><span class="line">66</span><br><span class="line">67</span><br><span class="line">68</span><br><span class="line">69</span><br><span class="line">70</span><br><span class="line">71</span><br><span class="line">72</span><br><span class="line">73</span><br><span class="line">74</span><br><span class="line">75</span><br><span class="line">76</span><br><span class="line">77</span><br><span class="line">78</span><br><span class="line">79</span><br><span class="line">80</span><br><span class="line">81</span><br><span class="line">82</span><br><span class="line">83</span><br><span class="line">84</span><br><span class="line">85</span><br><span class="line">86</span><br><span class="line">87</span><br><span class="line">88</span><br><span class="line">89</span><br><span class="line">90</span><br><span class="line">91</span><br><span class="line">92</span><br><span class="line">93</span><br><span class="line">94</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ============================================================</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Initial relaxation for Si / 3C-SiC(001) interface slab</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Model: 12x12 Si / 15x15 3C-SiC</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># type 1 = Si, type 2 = C</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Potential: SiCGe.tersoff</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Boundary: p p f</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Bottom 10 Å fixed</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># No box/relax</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ============================================================</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">clear</span><br><span class="line">units           metal</span><br><span class="line">dimension       3</span><br><span class="line">boundary        p p f</span><br><span class="line">atom_style      atomic</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -----------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Read Atomsk-generated data file</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -----------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line">read_data       D:\\AAAtest\\Si_C260320\\260326_longtimeRelaxation\\Plus\\interface_vaccum.lmp</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -----------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Interatomic potential</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># type 1 = Si</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># type 2 = C</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -----------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line">pair_style      tersoff</span><br><span class="line">pair_coeff      * * SiC.tersoff Si C</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -----------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Neighbor settings</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -----------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line">neighbor        2.0 bin</span><br><span class="line">neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check <span class="built_in">yes</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -----------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Define bottom fixed region</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Fixed thickness = 10 Å from lower z boundary</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -----------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line">variable        zlo0 equal zlo <span class="comment"># 找到模拟盒子的 z 方向下边界 zlo</span></span><br><span class="line">variable        zfix equal v_zlo0+10.0</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">region          bottom block INF INF INF INF <span class="variable">$&#123;zlo0&#125;</span> <span class="variable">$&#123;zfix&#125;</span> units box <span class="comment"># 从 zlo 到 zlo + 10 Å 定义为 bottom 区域</span></span><br><span class="line">group           fixed_bottom region bottom</span><br><span class="line">group           mobile subtract all fixed_bottom <span class="comment"># 包含所有原子减去 fixed_bottom组的原子</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ------------------------注释---------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 定义一个名为 bottom的空间区域</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># block表示矩形区域</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 范围定义：xlo xhi ylo yhi zlo zhi</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># INF INF：x方向从负无穷到正无穷（实际为整个盒子x范围）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># INF INF：y方向从负无穷到正无穷（实际为整个盒子y范围）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># $&#123;zlo0&#125; $&#123;zfix&#125;：z方向从下边界到zfix位置</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># units box：使用盒子坐标系单位</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 这个区域是盒子底部10埃厚的薄层</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ------------------------------------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Freeze bottom substrate atoms</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 把底部原子的受力清零</span></span><br><span class="line">velocity        fixed_bottom <span class="built_in">set</span> 0.0 0.0 0.0 <span class="comment"># 用于冻结某些原子，在分子动力学和能量最小化中都可使用</span></span><br><span class="line">fix             freeze fixed_bottom setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -----------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Output settings</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -----------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line">reset_timestep  0</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">thermo          100</span><br><span class="line">thermo_style    custom step atoms pe etotal fnorm fmax press pxx pyy pzz lx ly lz</span><br><span class="line">thermo_modify   lost error</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">dump            drelax all custom 200 dump.relax_Si_3CSiC <span class="built_in">id</span> <span class="built_in">type</span> x y z fx fy fz</span><br><span class="line">dump_modify     drelax <span class="built_in">sort</span> <span class="built_in">id</span> element Si C</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -----------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Energy minimization</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Stage 1: very conservative relaxation</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -----------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line">min_style       cg</span><br><span class="line">min_modify      dmax 0.02 line quadratic</span><br><span class="line">minimize        1.0e-8 1.0e-6 5000 50000</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -----------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Stage 2: continue relaxation with larger allowed displacement</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -----------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line">min_modify      dmax 0.05 line quadratic</span><br><span class="line">minimize        1.0e-10 1.0e-8 10000 100000</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -----------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Write final relaxed structure</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -----------------------------</span></span><br><span class="line">write_data      Si_3CSiC_001_Cterm_interface_relaxed.data</span><br><span class="line">write_dump      all custom Si_3CSiC_001_Cterm_interface_relaxed.dump <span class="built_in">id</span> <span class="built_in">type</span> x y z modify <span class="built_in">sort</span> <span class="built_in">id</span> element Si C</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>           <span class="string">&quot;Relaxation finished.&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>细弛豫，采用 fire 算法进行能量最小化</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">clear</span><br><span class="line">units           metal</span><br><span class="line">dimension       3</span><br><span class="line">boundary        p p f</span><br><span class="line">atom_style      atomic</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">read_data       D:\\AAAtest\\Si_C260320\\260326_longtimeRelaxation\\Plus\\Si_3CSiC_001_Cterm_interface_relaxed.data</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">pair_style      tersoff</span><br><span class="line">pair_coeff      * * SiC.tersoff Si C</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">neighbor        2.0 bin</span><br><span class="line">neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check <span class="built_in">yes</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">variable        zlo0 equal zlo</span><br><span class="line">variable        zfix equal v_zlo0+10.0</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">region          bottom block INF INF INF INF <span class="variable">$&#123;zlo0&#125;</span> <span class="variable">$&#123;zfix&#125;</span> units box</span><br><span class="line">group           fixed_bottom region bottom</span><br><span class="line">group           mobile subtract all fixed_bottom</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">velocity        fixed_bottom <span class="built_in">set</span> 0.0 0.0 0.0</span><br><span class="line">fix             freeze fixed_bottom setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">reset_timestep  0</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">thermo          100</span><br><span class="line">thermo_style    custom step atoms pe etotal fnorm fmax press pxx pyy pzz lx ly lz</span><br><span class="line">thermo_modify   lost error</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">dump            dcont all custom 200 dump.continue_Si_3CSiC <span class="built_in">id</span> <span class="built_in">type</span> x y z fx fy fz</span><br><span class="line">dump_modify     dcont <span class="built_in">sort</span> <span class="built_in">id</span> element Si C</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">min_style       fire</span><br><span class="line">min_modify      dmax 0.03 line quadratic</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">minimize        1.0e-12 1.0e-10 20000 200000</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">write_data      Si_3CSiC_001_Cterm_interface_relaxed_continue.data</span><br><span class="line">write_dump      all custom Si_3CSiC_001_Cterm_interface_relaxed_continue.dump <span class="built_in">id</span> <span class="built_in">type</span> x y z modify <span class="built_in">sort</span> <span class="built_in">id</span> element Si C</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>           <span class="string">&quot;Continue relaxation finished.&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="终止面选择"><a href="#终止面选择" class="headerlink" title="终止面选择"></a>终止面选择</h3><ul><li>C Si→ C‑terminated interface</li><li>Si C→ Si‑terminated interface</li></ul><h3 id="shift-与-wrap-指令使用注意"><a href="#shift-与-wrap-指令使用注意" class="headerlink" title="shift 与 wrap 指令使用注意"></a>shift 与 wrap 指令使用注意</h3><ol><li>-shift 最容易错在：只移动原子，不移动盒子<br>-shift 的本质是把全部或部分原子按给定向量平移；它可以移动全部原子，也可以移动某个平面 above&#x2F;below 一侧的原子。官方文档说明它是按位移向量移动体系或选中部分原子。<br>常见错误是：</li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">-<span class="built_in">shift</span> 0 0 10</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>你以为是“把盒子加长 10 Å”或“增加真空层”，但实际上只是把原子整体往 z 方向移动了 10 Å，盒子的尺寸并没有变。<br>所以如果你想增加真空层，应该用类似：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">-cell add 0 0 20</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>而不是只用 -shift。</p><ol start="2"><li>-wrap 最容易错在：把你故意移出盒子的原子重新包回盒子<br>-wrap 的作用是把盒子外的原子沿晶胞矢量重新放回盒子内部；Atomsk 不会自动应用周期边界，只有显式使用 -wrap 才会这么做。<br>问题是：你在做界面模型时，很多时候是故意用 shift 调整上下两块材料的位置，比如设置 Si 和 SiC 的界面间距：</li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">-<span class="built_in">shift</span> 0 0 1.89</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>如果后面又随手加了：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">-wrap</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>可能会发生：原本在上方的 SiC 原子被 wrap 到盒子底部或另一侧<br>界面距离、真空层、上下材料顺序全部可能乱掉<br>这在 OVITO 里有时候看起来像：<br>界面突然重叠<br>真空层消失<br>上下晶体穿插<br>原子跑到盒子另一边<br>界面距离变得很奇怪</p><h2 id="4-5-方案与-12-15-方案区别✨"><a href="#4-5-方案与-12-15-方案区别✨" class="headerlink" title="4:5 方案与 12:15 方案区别✨"></a>4:5 方案与 12:15 方案区别✨</h2><p>我曾经构建过 4×4 Si &#x2F; 5×5 SiC 的 4:5 匹配方案，且其中 SiC 是基底。当前工作则是 12×12 Si &#x2F; 15×15 SiC 的三倍扩展模型，但基底方向和应变承担方发生了变化。</p><table><thead><tr><th align="left">对比项</th><th align="left">曾经的 4:5 方案</th><th align="left">当前 12:15 方案</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">平面内比例</td><td align="left">4×4 Si &#x2F; 5×5 SiC</td><td align="left">12×12 Si &#x2F; 15×15 SiC</td></tr><tr><td align="left">尺寸</td><td align="left">较小模型</td><td align="left">中等尺寸模型，是 4:5 的三倍扩展</td></tr><tr><td align="left">基底</td><td align="left">SiC 为基底</td><td align="left">Si 为基底</td></tr><tr><td align="left">应变处理</td><td align="left">对 Si 做 +0.34% 拉伸以匹配 SiC</td><td align="left">对 SiC 做 -0.34% 压缩以匹配 Si</td></tr><tr><td align="left">上层材料</td><td align="left">Si 在上方</td><td align="left">3C-SiC 在上方</td></tr><tr><td align="left">LAMMPS 流程</td><td align="left">最小化后还做 NVT 平衡</td><td align="left">CG 粗弛豫 + FIRE 精弛豫；当前不做 NVT</td></tr><tr><td align="left">基底固定</td><td align="left">旧脚本未明确固定底部基底</td><td align="left">固定底部 10 Å Si 基底</td></tr><tr><td align="left">最终结构定位</td><td align="left">经典势热平衡&#x2F;初步弛豫结构</td><td align="left">经典势 0 K 充分弛豫结构</td></tr></tbody></table><p>从 LAMMPS 操作角度看，以前比现在多了 NVT 平衡。但旧结构“界面看起来更融合”不能简单说明其更合理，因为 NVT 后的单帧包含热振动，且旧模型没有固定基底；当前静态界面模型的合理性主要应依据最近邻距离、界面成键、异常短键、总能量与最终力收敛共同判断。</p><p>对于 12×12 Si &#x2F; 15×15 SiC, 当前 FIRE 结果已经达到非常充分的经典势力收敛；如果目标是 0 K 几何弛豫，不需要再继续做 CG 或 FIRE。若未来要研究 300 K 热稳定性，可在当前结构基础上做 NVT，再进行一次最终 minimize；但不建议直接把 NVT 最后一帧当作静态最终结构。</p><ul><li>4:5 方案<br><img src="/img/4x5.png" alt="4x5界面结构"></li><li>12:15 方案<br><img src="/img/12x15.png" alt="12x15界面结构"><br><img src="/img/12x15_Slice.png" alt="12x15 Slice切割"></li></ul>]]></content>
      
      
